{"title":"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a9874ea56cf8fec1bd246793224fbcfaad17ab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be points in the Cartesian plane each a distance <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from the origin <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. We deﬁne addition of points in the plane componentwise (If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1ba94d0fbee62662666f36becf81e3be29dc003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = (p_x,p_y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c72b18824e983adeffbafcedce1f92402b718406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q = (q_x,q_y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/2172fe20660983f956c054986752f40b943315ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P + Q = (p_x + q_x,p_y + q_y))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"214\" height=\"18\" />. Show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/9/3b959b1c34dee6c2ffa0f570a4132b95f6b0505a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B + C + D = (0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"188\" height=\"18\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a9874ea56cf8fec1bd246793224fbcfaad17ab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are the vertices of a rectangle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2018 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Proble